the director but I'm not one of those&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.960
people who likes gratuitous movement.&nbsp;
I've worked on shows there are certain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:26.960
styles of filmmaking or gratuitous movement and&nbsp;
she's like always keep the camera moving I like it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:35.040
to be motivated I like there to be a reason for it&nbsp;
to be moving and and I just intuitively it's like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:40.960
when I'm in that space I’ll feel that moment where&nbsp;
I'm like we really should go from here and then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:47.440
slide over to that person or just how cool we got&nbsp;
to follow them in through this door and outside&nbsp;&nbsp;

