complicate lighting because you have to hide&nbsp;
stands you're seeing more of the space you have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:13.200
to have a and I if I was given a choice between&nbsp;
moving a camera or doing cool lighting I would I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:19.840
would probably do the cool lighting I know people&nbsp;
who do less than cool lighting to permit more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:27.600
camera movement and that again that's a legitimate&nbsp;
aesthetic but it's not my preferred aesthetic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:36.720
but but in a perfect world you could have both&nbsp;
and again like I said I just unmotivated movement&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:42.800
it's a distraction I just I think even with&nbsp;
lighting I mean you could do cool lighting that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:50.240
doesn't complement a scene and and it should never&nbsp;
be about making yourself look good it should be&nbsp;&nbsp;

